# Way of the Necromancer (turn 1, off Moxen): empower Jace 2 makes a Jace token with 2 loyalty; Wrenn and Six (3 loyalty) is a second
# planeswalker. Turn 2 Bot2 empowers its own Jace to 5 with Way of the Healer. Turn 3 Bot1 adds a second Ornithopter. Turn 4 Bot2's
# Pyroclasm kills both Ornithopters at once: "Whenever a creature you control dies" triggers once for each (CR 603.10a, the Way
# still on the battlefield), and each trigger puts a loyalty counter on each planeswalker Bot1 controls (CR 306.5c, 122.1e): the Jace
# token 2 to 4 and Wrenn and Six 3 to 5, while Bot2's Jace token stays at 5 (Bot2 controls the creatures that did not die).

